[{"source": "app\\Document\\college_rules.md", "text": "# College Rules ## Attendance Policy [Students must maintain at least 75% attendance to be eligible for their final examinations.] ## Library Policy [ 1. Students can borrow a maximum of 3 books from the college library at one time. 2. The library borrowing period is 14 days. 3. Students who return books late must pay a late fee of Rs. 10 per day for each overdue book. 4. Students must carry their college identity card while entering the library. ] ## Fee Policy [ 1. Students must pay their college fees according to the official fee schedule. 2. Students should contact the college accounts department for fee payment queries. ] ## Admission Policy [ Students must contact the college admission office for admission-related queries.] ## Examination Policy [Enter examination eligibility and approved examination rules.] 9. The college office operates Monday to Friday, from 9:00 AM to 4:00 PM. 10. Students should contact their Head of Department for department-related academic queries.", "embedding": [0.0024525402, 0.021026097, 0.01337223, -0.04487042, 0.0015027, 0.0040355464, 0.004020026, 0.027416395, -0.0031013342, -0.014617961, -0.016331494, -0.021557614, 0.008952844, 0.01541888, 0.12379384, 0.032348808, 0.0016722379, 0.020820439, -0.0051973537, -0.016842384, -0.00014019037, 0.0005339776, -0.002727436, -0.017192887, -0.014968778, -0.003525898, 0.033040784, 0.0047161737, 0.017703293, 0.005416779, -0.031546548, 0.0013039887, 0.003683817, 0.012689998, -0.0028120843, -0.0014983508, -0.016851958, 0.016742278, 0.0062651928, 0.018882833, 0.008900053, 0.04273644, -0.023630224, 0.006776758, -0.0052936226, -0.0030794947, -0.00081397314, -0.028994355, -0.00021872952, 0.02596684, -0.00022987614, 0.0022598538, 0.007013414, -0.21608384, 0.007994089, 0.0036446408, 0.00939876, 0.003936009, -0.005572318, -0.007547598, -0.019843556, 0.009294731, -0.017374216, 0.01228504, -0.01710155, -0.017324684, 0.013136213, 0.0128573235, -0.00979